lize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!yA2x1naRYEaelWa4.RZfMWcVtBQVi2pCA"},{"_id":"qarlOKy2gtbDmhfN","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Corrupted Touch","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A corrupted nosoi's Strikes deal @Damage[1d6[void]] damage to living creatures. A creature critically hit by a corrupted nosoi's Strike must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:18] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} on a critical failure) as rot spreads through their flesh.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"damageType":"void","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d6","key":"DamageDice","predicate":["target:mode:living"],"selector":"strike-damage"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!yA2x1naRYEaelWa4.qarlOKy2gtbDmhfN"},{"_id":"THAwoUoO7vQWUsob","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Haunting Melody","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The nosoi croons \"<em>the Lord slumbers below, you're nothing but his dreams, and when the lord awakes, you'll know the end of things!</em>\". Each living or undead creature within a @Template[emanation|distance:60] must attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save. The effect lasts for 1 round, but a nosoi can use this ability again on subsequent rounds to extend the duration by 1 round for all affected creatures. A creature that succeeds at any save is temporarily immune for 24 hours. Despite being a mental effect, this ability affects mindless undead. Psychopomps are immune to this ability.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, and the creature must spend each of its actions on its turn to move closer to the nosoi as expediently as possible while avoiding obvious dangers. If a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AdPVz7rbaVSRxHFg]{Fascinated} creature is adjacent to the nosoi, it stays still and doesn't act. If the creature is attacked, the fascination ends.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["auditory","concentrate","divine","incapacitation","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!yA2x1naRYEaelWa4.THAwoUoO7vQWUsob"}],"name":"Corrupted Nosoi","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":1},"dex":{"mod":3},"int":{"mod":1},"str":{"mod":-1},"wis":{"mod":2}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":18},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":28,"temp":0,"value":28},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"}],"resistances":[{"type":"void","value":3}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":40}],"value":15},"weaknesses":[{"type":"slashing","value":3}]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["chthonian","diabolic","empyrean","requian"]},"level":{"value":2},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"","publication":{